{
  "title": "Example group",
  "context": "com_contact.mail",
  "description": ""
}

### Get Contacts Mail Field Group
# @name Get Contacts Mail Field Group
GET {{base_url}}/v1/fields/groups/contacts/mail/{{group_id}}
X-Joomla-Token: {{api_key}}
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Update Contacts Mail Field Group
